WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:11.160
My brother is on the bridge.

2
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:15.940
He sees a dragon near the tree.

3
00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:20.240
The dragon plays the drum.

4
00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:27.120
He sees a troll on a tractor.

5
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:31.800
The troll eats grapes.

6
00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:39.730
He sees a crocodile in the creek.

7
00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:44.430
The crocodile finds fruit.

8
00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:49.310
He sees a frog in the creek.

9
00:00:49.970 --> 00:00:53.570
The frog kisses a princess.

10
00:00:56.850 --> 00:01:01.730
He sees a prince next to the princess.

11
00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:04.949
The prince wears a crown.

12
00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:11.250
He sees a train on the green grass.

13
00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:15.030
The train starts to travel.

14
00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:27.060
The train travels up and away!

15
